This code ganatares the initial thermodynamic trajectories that will be evolve using WinNet.
The parameters used as initial conditions are:

Temperature         = T_0
Entropy_per_baryon  = s_0
Electron_fraction   = Y_e,0

WinNet nuclear reation network uses as thermodynamic input a trajectory specifying 4 columns

#time[s],    T9[GK], density[g/cm^3],    R[Km],  Y_e

In this code we will take (T_0,s_0 and Ye0) and evolve 1ms the T9, rho, R and Ye.

